  "bodyHtml": "<div id=\"service-container\" class=\"container-fluid\">\n<h1 id=\"about-top-title\" class=\"h1-1\">壓力桶選擇工具</h1>\n\t<div id=\"select_tools\" class=\"container\">\n    \t\t<div class=\"service_spacing-2\"></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"st_txt_style1\">\n            \t<p class=\"lang_rtl\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">溢康擁有多年來良好的客戶服務經驗，對於系統尺寸設計具有豐富的經驗。我們結合設計工程師、零售商和技術人員,將依照您的需求,用計算公式和評估技術數據,提供給您最適合的壓力桶尺寸。這個工具不但使複雜變得簡單,且可以讓您快速又準確地找到我們(AQUASKY PLUS)產品系列裡,您最合適的壓力桶尺寸。透過簡單的壓力資料點擊，這個工具可以為您的系統顯示最適合的壓力桶尺寸</p>\n            </div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"service_spacing-2\"></div>\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"row\">\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"step_style-1\"><p>STEP 1</p></div>\n                </div>\n              <div class=\"col-sm-9\">\n                    <div class=\"step_style-2\">\n                        <div class=\"step_bottom_border\">SELECT UNIT</div>\n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                        \t<div id=\"btn_select_bar\" class=\"col-sm-6 select_btn btn_active\">Bar</div>\n                        \t<div id=\"btn_select_psi\" class=\"col-sm-6 select_btn\">PSI</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"step_arrow_down\"><img src=\"/images/arrow_down.jpg\" width=\"78\" height=\"66\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"select_bar\">\n\n<form name=\"form1\" method=\"post\" action=\"#\" class=\"form-horizontal\">\n<input id=\"select_unit_A\" name=\"select_unit\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"bar\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-6 px-0\">\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"row\">\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"step_style-1\"><p>STEP 2</p></div>\n                </div>\n              <div class=\"col-sm-9\">\n                    <div class=\"step_style-2\">\n                        <div class=\"step_bottom_border\">FINDING AF</div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Cut-in pressure</p></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4\"><input id=\"input_cut_in\" name=\"input_cut_in\" type=\"number\" class=\"form-control text-center\" value=\"1\" maxlength=\"2\" min=\"1.0\" max=\"14.0\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Bar 1.0~14.0</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Cut-out pressure</p></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4\"><input id=\"input_cut_out\" name=\"input_cut_out\" type=\"number\" class=\"form-control text-center\" value=\"2\" maxlength=\"2\" min=\"2.0\" max=\"16.0\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Bar 2.0~16.0</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top setp_space_bottom\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Acceptance Factor</p></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n                            \t<div class=\"form-control AF_bg text-center\" id=\"out_Acceptance_Factor\"></div>\n                                <input id=\"val_Acceptance_Factor\" name=\"val_Acceptance_Factor\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>OUT>IN</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"step_arrow_down\"><img src=\"/images/arrow_down.jpg\" width=\"78\" height=\"66\"></div>\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"row\">\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"step_style-1\"><p>STEP 3</p></div>\n                </div>\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-9\">\n                    <div class=\"step_style-2\">\n                    \t<div class=\"step_bottom_border\">FINDIND WATER FLOW</div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Minimum Run Time</p></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4\"><input id=\"input_Minimum\" name=\"input_Minimum\" type=\"number\" class=\"form-control text-center\" value=\"1\" maxlength=\"1\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>min 1~4</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Litre per Minute</p></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4\"><input id=\"input_Litre\" name=\"input_Litre\" type=\"number\" class=\"form-control text-center\" value=\"1\" maxlength=\"3\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>L 1~100</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top setp_space_bottom\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Total Water Needed</p></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n                            \t<div id=\"out_total_WN\" class=\"form-control AF_bg text-center\"></div>\n                            \t<input id=\"val_Total_WN\" name=\"val_Total_WN\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>L</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"step_arrow_down\"><img src=\"/images/arrow_down.jpg\" width=\"78\" height=\"66\"></div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 px-0\">\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"row\">\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"step_style-1\"><p>